    "body": "## User story\nAs an analyst, I want suppliers chosen by cheapest, fastest or a balanced score, so that I can compare sourcing policies.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- select_supplier in src/suppliers.py supporting cheapest, fastest and balanced\n- Worked example: S-002 wins balanced for P-001 on the sample config\n- Rules as in Team Context Document 7.3 (F-012)\n- Depends on B-04 (Supplier model)\n\n## Tests\n- TC-SUP-10 to TC-SUP-15 in tests/test_suppliers.py\n\n## Definition of done\n- [ ] Code and tests in one PR, CI green, coverage not lower than before\n- [ ] PR body says \"Closes #<this issue>\"\n- [ ] Reviewed and merged by Meghana; branch deleted; card in Done",
